OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Fdry through the evening with clear
OL,7,Fspells. Remaining dry and largely
OL,8,Fclear overnight. Light winds in the
OL,9,Fevening becoming fresh south to
OL,10,Fsoutheasterlies overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA dry and bright but breezy
OL,13,Fstart. Becoming cloudy through the
OL,14,Fafternoon with a little light rain,
OL,15,Fand with strengthening south to
OL,16,Fsoutheast winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
