OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FWet
OL,6,Fand windy start Tuesday then sunshine
OL,7,Ffor a time before showers and gales
OL,8,Flater. Dry, bright start Wednesday
OL,9,Fbefore occasionally heavy rain later,
OL,10,Fclearing on Thursday. Southwesterly
OL,11,Fgales Wednesday.
